  "question": {
    "text": "The area&nbsp;(in square units) of the triangle bounded by <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>4</mn></math> and the lines <math><msup><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>-</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></math> is equal to"
